DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
26812::$$$message_0199_0000_0000$$$::...Come to think of it, there was a letter for Tohsaka.::
26813::$$$message_0199_0001_0000$$$::"Sakura, you here?"[lr]::
26814::$$$message_0199_0001_0001$$$::"Senpai? Yes, you can come in!"[lr]::
26815::$$$message_0199_0001_0002$$$::Sakura sounds busy.[lr]::
26816::$$$message_0199_0001_0003$$$::"Coming in!"[lr]::
26817::$$$message_0199_0001_0004$$$::Sakura is writing something.[lr]::
26818::$$$message_0199_0001_0005$$$::There's a large piece of writing paper on the table.::
26819::$$$message_0199_0002_0000$$$::"That's the letter you mentioned before, right?"[lr]::
26820::$$$message_0199_0002_0001$$$::"Yes. I want to send my sister a report about recent events. Just a moment. I'll be done soon."::
26821::$$$message_0199_0003_0000$$$::The recipient is in London.[lr]::
26822::$$$message_0199_0003_0001$$$::We can't contact her on a moment's notice, so this would be a good time to send her a letter.[lr]::
26823::$$$message_0199_0003_0002$$$::...E-mail would be easier, but Tohsaka stubbornly refuses to use a computer.::
26824::$$$message_0199_0004_0000$$$::"...Hey, Sakura. Do you think Tohsaka will come home anytime soon?"[lr]::
26825::$$$message_0199_0004_0001$$$::"I don't think she can in the near future. She said that October would be difficult, and she'll let us know if she does decide to come back."[lr]::
26826::$$$message_0199_0004_0002$$$::"Oh. So she probably won't be back by the 11th."::
26827::$$$message_0199_0005_0000$$$::Things aren't going so well. If Tohsaka was here, she could figure out this half-cocked situation right away... Okay, maybe not right away, but I think she would find us some leads.::
26828::$$$message_0199_0006_0000$$$::"Hehe. Do you want her to come back?"[lr]::
26829::$$$message_0199_0006_0001$$$::Sakura asks.[lr]::
26830::$$$message_0199_0006_0002$$$::She seems happy about it.::
26831::$$$message_0199_0007_0000$$$::"N-not really.[lr]::
26832::$$$message_0199_0007_0001$$$::I can only relax mentally when she's not around. It's not a problem for me if she travels a lot this year."::
26833::$$$message_0199_0008_0000$$$::"Uh-huh?[wm canskip=0][cacheimage storage=桜私服06a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=桜私服06a(中)] That sounds like, 'she doesn't have to come back this year, but I'll run out of patience if she isn't back next year!' That's how you really feel, isn't it?"::
26834::$$$message_0199_0009_0000$$$::"Urgh..."[lr]::
26835::$$$message_0199_0009_0001$$$::I don't know what to say. Sakura's growing more formidable day by day.[lr]::
26836::$$$message_0199_0009_0002$$$::She's been maturing even without her big sister around. She's been surrounded by a lot of unique people lately, so it must be educational for her.[lr]::
26837::$$$message_0199_0009_0003$$$::...I wonder what would happen if Tohsaka came back now.::
26838::$$$message_0199_0010_0000$$$::"...Well, setting aside how noisy it would be once she's back... There is something I want to consult her about, if I'm being honest.[lr]::
26839::$$$message_0199_0010_0001$$$::Do you mind asking her to reach out to me in your letter?"::
26840::$$$message_0199_0011_0000$$$::"Oh, is that all? [cacheimage storage=桜私服02a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜私服02a(中)]She might miss it if you don't say something with a little more feeling.[lr]::
26841::$$$message_0199_0011_0001$$$::If anything, she's liable to throw the letter away if it doesn't sound urgent enough."::
26842::$$$message_0199_0012_0000$$$::"...The amazing thing about her is that I can't even deny it.[lr]::
26843::$$$message_0199_0012_0001$$$::Okay. Then tell her I'm in a little trouble and that I'd like her to contact me if she feels up to it. Tell her I want her help... Ah, no, not that. She's busy. I can't ask her to come back for this. This is an important time for her, so I shouldn't interrupt..."::
26844::$$$message_0199_0013_0000$$$::"...Actually, never mind. She might actually make things worse if she comes back, and I think there's a risk that things could spiral out of control. [cacheimage storage=桜私服01c(中)][wvl][seloop storage=se594.wav time=100][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜私服01c(中)]She's doing whatever she wants in London, so I should do the same here. Okay, I've made up my mind."::
26845::$$$message_0199_0014_0000$$$::That was close.[lr]::
26846::$$$message_0199_0014_0001$$$::How big of a favor would I owe Tohsaka if I asked her to come home now?[lr]::
26847::$$$message_0199_0014_0002$$$::She might force me to be her butler for a whole year overseas.::
26848::$$$message_0199_0015_0000$$$::"Senpai? Is that everything you wanted to say?"[lr]::
26849::$$$message_0199_0015_0001$$$::"Huh? Uh, no... Um, go with the first thing I said. Just write that I'd like her to reach out. It's all right if she doesn't notice it. Even if she doesn't help, I'll figure this out on my own."::
26850::$$$message_0199_0016_0000$$$::"'...on my own.' Okay.[lr]::
26851::$$$message_0199_0016_0001$$$::All right, I got that all down. I'll mail it out first thing tomorrow morning!"[wvs][se storage=se595.wav][lr]::
26852::$$$message_0199_0016_0002$$$::Sakura quickly puts the letter in the envelope and seals it with a cute sticker.::
26853::$$$message_0199_0017_0000$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
26854::$$$message_0199_0017_0001$$$::I feel like there's something suspicious about the way she did that, but I must be imagining it.[lr]::
26855::$$$message_0199_0017_0002$$$::"Thanks. I'll leave you to it then."[lr]::
26856::$$$message_0199_0017_0003$$$::"Please look forward to the response!"[lr]::
26857::$$$message_0199_0017_0004$$$::There's something about that smile...[lr]::
26858::$$$message_0199_0017_0005$$$::Like I flipped a switch I shouldn't have.::
926819::$$$message_9199_0002_0000$$$::"That's the letter you mentioned before, right?"[r]::�J